 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "接下来，看数据存在哪里。",
   "spoken": "接下来，看数据存在哪里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "每个合约都有一张巨大的键值表，叫存储。键和值都是 32 字节，键叫做槽位。",
   "spoken": "每个合约都有一张巨大的键值表，叫存储。键和值都是 32 字节，键叫做槽位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.108,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 5.206,
   "speechEnd": 12.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "可以把它想成一排抽屉柜。每个抽屉 32 字节，从 0 号开始编号。",
   "spoken": "可以把它想成一排抽屉柜。每个抽屉 32 字节，从 0 号开始编号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.44,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 13.538,
   "speechEnd": 18.964
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "规则一，状态变量按声明顺序，从 0 号槽开始放。",
   "spoken": "规则一，状态变量按声明顺序，从 0 号槽开始放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.02,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 20.118,
   "speechEnd": 24.427
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "规则二，相邻的变量加起来不超过 32 字节，编译器就把它们打包进同一个槽。",
   "spoken": "规则二，相邻的变量加起来不超过 32 字节，编译器就把它们打包进同一个槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.472,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 25.57,
   "speechEnd": 31.808
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "看一个例子。owner 是地址，占 20 字节，放进 0 号槽。",
   "spoken": "看一个例子。owner 是地址，占 20 字节，放进 0 号槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 32.844,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 32.942,
   "speechEnd": 37.665
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "paused 是布尔值，占 1 字节，也挤进 0 号槽。",
   "spoken": "paused 是布尔值，占 1 字节，也挤进 0 号槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.704,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 38.802,
   "speechEnd": 42.23
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "fee 是 96 位整数，占 12 字节。20 加 1 加 12 是 33，放不下了。",
   "spoken": "fee 是 96 位整数，占 12 字节。20 加 1 加 12 是 33，放不下了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.268,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 43.366,
   "speechEnd": 49.363
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "所以 fee 去了 1 号槽，total 顺延到 2 号槽。",
   "spoken": "所以 fee 去了 1 号槽，total 顺延到 2 号槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 50.424,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 50.522,
   "speechEnd": 54.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "如果把 fee 改成 88 位，也就是 11 字节，三个变量正好 32 字节，全部挤进 0 号槽。",
   "spoken": "如果把 fee 改成 88 位，也就是 11 字节，三个变量正好 32 字节，全部挤进 0 号槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 55.348,
   "dur": 7.848,
   "speechStart": 55.446,
   "speechEnd": 62.374
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "total 就从 2 号槽，挪到了 1 号槽。代理升级时，这种挪动会让后面的变量全部错位。",
   "spoken": "total 就从 2 号槽，挪到了 1 号槽。代理升级时，这种挪动会让后面的变量全部错位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 63.416,
   "dur": 8.232,
   "speechStart": 63.514,
   "speechEnd": 70.797
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "规则三，mapping 自己占一个槽，这个槽是空的。元素放在键和槽号一起哈希出来的位置。",
   "spoken": "规则三，mapping 自己占一个槽，这个槽是空的。元素放在键和槽号一起哈希出来的位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 71.868,
   "dur": 8.472,
   "speechStart": 71.966,
   "speechEnd": 79.499
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "规则四，动态数组的槽里存长度。元素从槽号的哈希开始，依次往后排。",
   "spoken": "规则四，动态数组的槽里存常度。元素从槽号的哈希开始，依次往后排。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 80.56,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 80.658,
   "speechEnd": 87.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "规则五，常量和不可变量，不占存储槽。",
   "spoken": "规则五，常量和不可变量，不占存储槽。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 88.22,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 88.318,
   "speechEnd": 91.663
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "为什么这是安全问题？看四个场景。",
   "spoken": "为什么这是安全问题？看四个场景。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 92.712,
   "dur": 3.792,
   "speechStart": 92.81,
   "speechEnd": 95.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "第一，代理合约和实现合约的变量顺序不一致。实现合约以为在写 owner，实际改写了代理的实现地址。",
   "spoken": "第一，代理合约和实现合约的变量顺序不一致。实现合约以为在写 owner，实际改写了代理的实现地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 96.724,
   "dur": 9.264,
   "speechStart": 96.822,
   "speechEnd": 105.141
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "第二，升级时在中间插入新变量。后面的变量全部错位，余额可能被当成地址来读。",
   "spoken": "第二，升级时在中间插入新变量。后面的变量全部错位，余额可能被荡成地址来读。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 106.208,
   "dur": 8.064,
   "speechStart": 106.306,
   "speechEnd": 113.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "第三，用 private 变量存密码或种子。任何人通过 RPC 读一下存储，就能看到。",
   "spoken": "第三，用 private 变量存密码或种子。任何人通过 RPC 读一下存储，就能看到。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 114.492,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 114.59,
   "speechEnd": 121.456
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "第四，用 delegatecall 去调用不受信任的合约。对方的代码可以改写你的任何槽位，甚至让合约自毁。",
   "spoken": "第四，用 delegatecall 去掉用不受信任的合约。对方的代码可以改写你的任何槽位，甚至让合约自毁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 122.512,
   "dur": 9.072,
   "speechStart": 122.61,
   "speechEnd": 130.75
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "所以 EIP-1967 给代理定了固定的槽位。用哈希算出一个看起来随机的位置，避免和实现合约冲突。",
   "spoken": "所以 EIP-1967 给代理定了固定的槽位。用哈希算出一个看起来随机的位置，避免和实现合约冲突。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 131.804,
